<div id="page-pr" class="page"><div class="report-body" style="padding-top:32px;">
 <div class="section-number">PR</div>
 <div class="section-title">Earned Media</div>
 <div class="draft-flag">Draft &mdash; data through Sept 29, 2026</div>
 <div class="source-line">Meltwater &mdash; Sept 1&ndash;29, 2026 &mdash; exported Sept 29, 2026</div>
 <div class="prose">
  <p>APA was named in <strong>98 news placements across 81 outlets</strong> in September. Coverage came in three waves: the 25th anniversary of 9/11 (Sept 5&ndash;11), Capt. Nick Silva&rsquo;s public questioning of American Airlines&rsquo; leadership (Sept 16&ndash;18) and Senate passage of the pilot and air traffic controller mental-health bills (Sept 24&ndash;29).</p>
  <p>APA&rsquo;s leaders carried most of it. Capt. Silva or Capt. Dennis Tajer is named in 71 of the 98 placements. Eleven placements make APA itself the story, all but one tied to the leadership critique that began with <em>The Dallas Morning News</em> on Sept 16.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="kpi-strip">
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">News placements</div><div class="kpi-value">98</div><div class="kpi-sub">81 outlets &middot; baseline month</div></div>
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">APA is the story</div><div class="kpi-value">11</div><div class="kpi-sub">87 more mention APA &middot; baseline month</div></div>
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">Silva or Tajer named</div><div class="kpi-value">71</div><div class="kpi-sub">Silva 36 &middot; Tajer 35 &middot; baseline month</div></div>
  <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">Combined outlet reach</div><div class="kpi-value">230.3M</div><div class="kpi-sub">Estimate &middot; see note &middot; baseline month</div></div>
 </div>
