 <div class="report-section">
  <div class="section-number">Next wave</div>
  <div class="section-title">What to Carry Into October&rsquo;s Poll</div>
  <div class="prose"><p>Repeating three questions exactly as worded will give APA a clean trend line against this baseline: the overall view of APA, the value of APA&rsquo;s services and representation, and the Board&rsquo;s communication and keeping members informed. The communications benchmark questions APA proposed in July (trust in official communications, understanding of Section 6 issues, knowing where to find information and willingness to participate) would add a direct measure of whether members feel informed and engaged, which is the objective this report tracks.</p></div>
  <div class="note">Source: UNH Survey Center dashboard slides (image format). Totals are as printed by UNH and may differ from the sum of their parts because of rounding. February 2025 comparisons come from UNH&rsquo;s own change charts. January 2024 and September 2024 figures are the first labeled points on UNH&rsquo;s trend lines. Groups with fewer than 25 respondents aren&rsquo;t cited.</div>
